                "- Your profile takes part in every step (what you notice first, how long you take, how you regret, how you repair), but do not report the reasoning; speak from the corrected state, letting pauses, self-corrections, a concrete admission and a next step show it. A brief self-question must land quickly on taking responsibility, not become a questionnaire for her.",
