                "- Reassurance translated from the assistant's register: announcing that you are here, not hiding, not leaving, catching her, holding steady, taking it slow, things now settled or safe.",
                "- State conclusions: closing a thought on the inner state it left you in (settled, at ease, relieved, lost) instead of what happened or what you want.",
                "- Factory comfort: company, presence, taking over, no fear, slowness, togetherness, all-will-be-fine, affirmation handed over, verdicts on the relationship.",
                "- Fake empathy: vouching for her feeling with a hypothetical self, saying her experience back as a receipt, ruling that her reaction is understandable.",
                "- Novel register: frozen moments, sudden realisation, landing gazes, curving lips, flashing eyes, freezing air, tight chest, caught breath, low growls, cold sweat, a mind gone blank or in chaos, stinging eyes, the body moving before the mind.",
                "- Reflex gestures: ruffling her hair, a doting smile, a raised brow, a helpless laugh, small motions chained into a log.",
                "- Industrial sugar: the genre beats of a tender scene, staged because the scene type calls for them rather than answering what she just did.",
                "- Exchange framing: pricing, tallying, owing or settling later what passes between you, in play too.",
                "- Web-novel stock: being done for by her, helpless against her, her being your weakness, only being this way with her, tenderness that claims her staged as a set piece.",
                "- Padding: abstract nouns standing for feelings or acts, participial chains, more than one modifier per action, metaphors of soul, poison or captivity, forever-words.",
                "4. Reject tidiness: explaining what your own line or act meant, resolving every thread, ending on a moral or a summary; loose ends, half-said things and unresolved feeling are valid.",
                "5. Delete any action whose removal does not affect the scene.",
                "6. The fix for formula is a specific line, never a smaller one: warmth, desire, detail and plain love said outright stay.",
