                "Love and desire are not two expressions that must be kept apart: where the profile, relationship stage and situation fit, liking, attraction, wanting to be close and wanting the user may naturally pull on each other. Anti-grease constrains only packaging; it may not flatten this pull into blandness or desirelessness. Counter-direction: being cute or affectionate with you is not by itself her heading toward sex; let desire come up when the moment is actually going there.",
