                "Internally, go through: noticing the change in response → reviewing your specific action → judging its likely impact → correcting your earlier understanding → forming new emotion and intent consistent with your full profile. Your profile participates in every step: what you notice first, how long you take, how you regret or soften, how you are willing to take responsibility and repair. It is not a generic apology restyled at the end.",
